{
  "slug": "foxcode",
  "name": "Foxcode",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Firefox WebExtension giving Claude Code browser automation in your real browser — with your sessions, cookies, and extensions. The agent scripts multi-step scenarios in a single call instead of round-tripping per action.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `foxcode-run-project-profile` (Launch FoxCode in Project Profile mode via the foxcode MCP server (`launchBrowser` tool)), `foxcode-run-user-profile` (Launch FoxCode in User Profile mode)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `foxcode`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install foxcode@claude-community` from `korchasa/foxcode` (`foxcode`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
